<Layout
  title="About Vyoma Security"
  description="Vyoma Security is an open-source, community-driven initiative focused on cybersecurity awareness, research, and defense."
  pubDate={new Date()}
>
  <p>
    <strong>Vyoma Security</strong> is a community-first cybersecurity initiative under the Vyoma
    ecosystem. Our goal is to make security knowledge accessible, practical, and transparent for
    developers, students, and everyday internet users.
  </p>

  <p>
    In a world where phishing attacks, data breaches, and digital surveillance are increasing,
    Vyoma Security focuses on <em>awareness before damage</em>. We believe prevention starts with
    understanding.
  </p>

  <p>
    Our work includes:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>Phishing & spam detection research</li>
    <li>Security-focused open-source tools</li>
    <li>Educational blogs and case studies</li>
    <li>Community-driven learning</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    Vyoma Security is built in public, open-source, and shaped by contributors who believe security
    should not be a luxury — it should be a default.
  </p>
</Layout>
